red: Welcome to SP_CE.\
You must have gone through a lot to be sent here. I hardly recognized you.
red: ...
red: Oh this? No, I'm not Death. I just like red hoodies.\
I'm here to help you.
red: Nobody can get through a journey like yours alone, and I hope you know you never actually are alone.
red: Why don't you head up the stairs, we'll get you back on track.